<item><title>Treasury records recurring MUNI payments for Djibloho hotel internet</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gq/treasury-records-recurring-muni-payments-for-djibloho-hotel-00818c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gq/treasury-records-recurring-muni-payments-for-djibloho-hotel-00818c/</guid><category>Equatorial Guinea</category><description>Diario Rombe says the state treasury accounts show payments for internet service at the Grand Hotel Djibloho, which began operating in August 2015.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 16:06:42 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gq/treasury-records-recurring-muni-payments-for-djibloho-hotel-00818c/share.jpg" length="45499" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gq/treasury-records-recurring-muni-payments-for-djibloho-hotel-00818c/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
